  "issues": [
    "Scope: The estimand calls for the difference in treatment response among all patients with complete measurements, but the analysis restricts to the treatment arm only, excluding control-arm patients.",
    "Unacknowledged data problem: 93 rows with sentinel baseline value (-999.0) were dropped; the analyst did not examine whether these missing baselines are disproportionately distributed by sex, which could bias the sex‑specific mean response.",
    "Overreach: The answer assumes baseline balance by sex due to randomisation without any check, yet no balance assessment was performed."
